{"version":1,"content":"<p>國際天文學研究團隊近日宣佈，在距離大爆炸僅約9億年的宇宙早期階段，發現了一對異常巨大的超級黑洞。由於它們形成和成長的速度遠超現有理論預測，這一發現正在挑戰科學界對於早期宇宙中超級黑洞起源的認知。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586818.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.142847+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:32:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_hash":"260a3c72341d75283c1df0830725bc79035a0747e0b77fdf82f3cc4ff242f19d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}